      "step": 1,
      "text": "Bone the {{ing_01|meat}} for the roulades—a pork loin, roll it, tie it, shape round, cover with or wrap in {{ing_02|rushes}}."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "text": "When done, retire, allow to drip and dry on the gridiron but so that the {{ing_01|meat}} does not harden."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "text": "Crush {{ing_03|pepper}}, {{ing_04|lovage}}, {{ing_02|rush}}, {{ing_05|cumin}}, adding {{ing_06|broth}} and {{ing_07|raisin wine}} to taste."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "text": "Place the roulades with this sauce together in a sauce pan."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "text": "When done, retire the roulades and dry them."
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "text": "Serve without the gravy sprinkled with {{ing_03|pepper}}."
    },
    {
